# Payload + CRUD Rules

- Every main collection supports full CRUD
- Soft-archive (`archived`, `delete: () => false`) is delete for this app
- Proper access control
- Mutations go through existing `/api/app/*` or Payload Local API — do not rip out working routes
- Always show loading + error states
- Revalidate after mutations
- Prefer Payload Local API on the server

Improve collections and APIs in place. Do not replace working productions, episodes, or board flows.
